Design a flotation circuit through connected streams and competing objectives (@mine-flotation-circuits: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @mining-and-mineral-engineering, #source "../sources/Tratamento-de-Minerios-CETEM.lingua#r_04ZQFADZ3NC3T6QDPQ565W1ERA", #source "../sources/CETEM-Praticas-Laboratoriais.lingua#r_44AAWXB1D7MBR9B0V3TYB8GF9B", #source "../sources/CETEM-Usinas-de-Beneficiamento.lingua#r_62ZD994C9YYXB1YDVFQST5B27J", #mining-and-mineral-engineering "Washing-desliming-attrition-and-fine-material.lingua#r_1HND71J50J4FJZ25ZB7XYWRQMJ") { r_2BZJNDFG57WRXSJX0GNMYG86DX
**Read:** [Tratamento de Minérios — CETEM, sixth edition](../sources/Tratamento-de-Minerios-CETEM.lingua#r_04ZQFADZ3NC3T6QDPQ565W1ERA), the full relevant flotation application chapters; [Tratamento de Minérios: Práticas Laboratoriais — Sampaio, França, and Braga](../sources/CETEM-Praticas-Laboratoriais.lingua#r_44AAWXB1D7MBR9B0V3TYB8GF9B), complete flotation and locked-cycle methods used in the comparison; [Usinas de Beneficiamento de Minérios do Brasil — CETEM](../sources/CETEM-Usinas-de-Beneficiamento.lingua#r_62ZD994C9YYXB1YDVFQST5B27J), two complete applicable plant cases and their full circuit descriptions.

Roughing, scavenging, cleaning, and recleaning describe duties within a flowsheet, not universally fixed machines or outcomes. A stage's useful recovery and selectivity depend on its own feed population and environment. Returning an intermediate stream changes residence, water, reagents, particle population, and circulating load elsewhere.

Close mass and valuable/deleterious constituent balances through the complete circuit. Distinguish recovery to a stage product from final saleable recovery. Concentrate grade may rise while overall valuable recovery falls; a higher local recovery may overload cleaning or increase impurities in the final product.

Use documented testwork to compare alternatives: sequential open tests, locked-cycle tests, continuous pilot work, and operating surveys answer different questions. A locked-cycle result can expose accumulation and recycle interactions but still has its own scale, time, and feed limits. Reconcile stream measurements before calibrating an elaborate circuit model.

**Work:** reconstruct two complete circuit alternatives for the same characterized feed and quality requirement. Derive the steady-state recycle balances, test their solution independently, and compare grade/recovery, circulating loads, water, reagent/energy accounts, variability, and likely operating constraints. Identify at least one feed change that could reverse the apparent ranking. Defend the proposed next pilot or operating experiment from the remaining uncertainty.

**Continue:** [Account for washing and desliming through the material actually removed](Washing-desliming-attrition-and-fine-material.lingua#r_1HND71J50J4FJZ25ZB7XYWRQMJ).

**Return:** [Mining and mineral engineering — extraction, processing, and continuing work](../Mining-and-mineral-engineering.lingua#r_22HJPS3RTK5EX1J55YJP75PHYA).
